17:["$","p","Slimmer You & Pamper Spa lists body contouring and fat-freeze services. A listing alone does not establish which option is right for you. Confirm the current service and equipment directly, and ask how the provider determines suitability before you make a decision.",{"children":"Slimmer You & Pamper Spa lists body contouring and fat-freeze services. A listing alone does not establish which option is right for you. Confirm the current service and equipment directly, and ask how the provider determines suitability before you make a decision."}]
18:["$","ul",null,{"children":[["$","li","Which treatment and device would be used?",{"children":"Which treatment and device would be used?"}],["$","li","Who would perform the service, and what training do they have?",{"children":"Who would perform the service, and what training do they have?"}],["$","li","What results are realistic for my goal?",{"children":"What results are realistic for my goal?"}],["$","li","How will we decide whether to proceed?",{"children":"How will we decide whether to proceed?"}]]}]
19:["$","section","risks-and-expectations",{"id":"risks-and-expectations","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Talk about limitations and possible side effects"}],[["$","p","Ask about common side effects, less common complications, aftercare, and who to contact if a concern arises. The FDA notes that risks vary by technology; some effects can be temporary, and complications can occur. Its guidance is general information from a U.S. regulator, not confirmation of any device’s Canadian authorization.",{"children":"Ask about common side effects, less common complications, aftercare, and who to contact if a concern arises. The FDA notes that risks vary by technology; some effects can be temporary, and complications can occur. Its guidance is general information from a U.S. regulator, not confirmation of any device’s Canadian authorization."}],["$","p","Discuss your health history privately with an appropriately qualified provider. If you need medical advice about whether a procedure is suitable, speak with your clinician. Take time to understand the answer; you do not need to decide at the first conversation.",{"children":"Discuss your health history privately with an appropriately qualified provider. If you need medical advice about whether a procedure is suitable, speak with your clinician. Take time to understand the answer; you do not need to decide at the first conversation."}]],"$undefined",["$","p",null,{"className":"article-source","children":["Further reading: ",["$","a",null,{"href":"https://www.fda.gov/medical-devices/aesthetic-cosmetic-devices/non-invasive-body-contouring-technologies","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","children":["FDA: Risks and considerations for non-invasive body contouring"," ↗"]}]]}]]}]
1a:["$","section","practical-details",{"id":"practical-details","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Get the practical details in writing"}],[["$","p","Ask about appointment length, the proposed number of visits, the full cost, and any cancellation or package terms. Clarify whether a quoted price covers one area or several. These details are best settled before committing to a course of treatments.",{"children":"Ask about appointment length, the proposed number of visits, the full cost, and any cancellation or package terms. Clarify whether a quoted price covers one area or several. These details are best settled before committing to a course of treatments."}],["$","p","You can use our calendar to request a body-contouring appointment or choose “Help me choose” for an initial conversation. The request does not charge you or confirm a treatment plan. Call the Hamilton spa at 365-833-0170 to confirm the appointment and discuss the information you need.",{"children":"You can use our calendar to request a body-contouring appointment or choose “Help me choose” for an initial conversation. The request does not charge you or confirm a treatment plan. Call the Hamilton spa at 365-833-0170 to confirm the appointment and discuss the information you need."}]],"$undefined","$undefined"]}]
